{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0325-s001", "text": "FPA betalar ut barnbidrag för alla barn varje månad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0325-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.085170068027211, "peak": 0.376251220703125, "generation_seconds": 8.87849970208481, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0325-s002", "text": "Syftet med barnbidraget är att stödja familjens ekonomi.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0325-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.314117431640625, "generation_seconds": 11.50179118802771, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0325-s003", "text": "FPA betalar ut barnbidrag fram till slutet av den månad då barnet fyller 17 år.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0325-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.2681884765625, "generation_seconds": 19.306201053783298, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0326-s001", "text": "FPA betalar ut barnbidrag för varje barn som bor stadigvarande i Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0326-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.316619873046875, "generation_seconds": 14.912949756952003, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0327-s001", "text": "En förälder som bor ensam med ett eller flera barn kan få förhöjt barnbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0327-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.265045166015625, "generation_seconds": 11.361396281048656, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0328-s001", "text": "På barnbidraget betalas ingen skatt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0328-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4133333333333336, "peak": 0.3609619140625, "generation_seconds": 7.44569055410102, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0329-s001", "text": "I vissa situationer kan barnbidrag också betalas om familjen vistas utomlands.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0329-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.273162841796875, "generation_seconds": 15.072318407008424, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0329-s002", "text": "Det kan också betalas för ett barn som är bosatt utomlands (om barnets förälder arbetar i Finland).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-barnbidrag/narration-resume-20261103T013134491765Z/hb-c09-u0329-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.498503401360544, "peak": 0.304718017578125, "generation_seconds": 21.437253263080493, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
